                    "is_best": true,
                    "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hi <user-mention data-id=\"105244\">@LH1</user-mention> </p>\n<p>have you excluded some SW going to change buck4 voltage thru I2C ?<br/>Is eMMC IO supply on STM32MP135 at 3.3V too (check VDDSD1/VDDSD2 if relevant) ?</p>\n<p><br/>Could you share the board model you are using. Is it a custom board where HW is not yet trustable ?</p>\n<p>Buck component choice and layout could be tricky.</p>\n<p>Is the 2.4V clean and stable or oscillating ?<br/><br/>Please look into <br/><a aria-label=\"Download file: AN5474\" class=\"st-table__cell-link active\" data-di-id=\"di-id-dbf93132-b73e14f4\" data-file-name=\"Getting started with STM32MP13x lines hardware development\" data-tracking='{\"page\":{\"pageInfo\":{\"breadCrumbs\":\"products:microcontrollers-microprocessors:stm32-arm-cortex-mpus:stm32mp1-series:stm32mp135:documentation\",\"pageShortName\":\"products:[...]:stm32mp135\",\"pageName\":\"products:microcontrollers-microprocessors:stm32-arm-cortex-mpus:stm32mp1-series:stm32mp135:documentation\",\"destinationURL\":\"https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32mp135/documentation.html\",\"isIframe\":false,\"contentIframe\":false,\"hierarchie1\":\"products:microcontrollers-microprocessors:stm32-arm-cortex-mpus:stm32mp1-series:stm32mp135:documentation\",\"hierarchie2\":\"\",\"sysEnv\":\"desktop\",\"pageID\":\"www.st.com:content:st_com_cx:en:products:microcontrollers-microprocessors:stm32-arm-cortex-mpus:stm32mp1-series:stm32mp135\",\"server\":\"www.st.com\",\"urlShortcut\":\"\",\"referringURL\":\"https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32mp135.html\",\"originalURL\":\"https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32mp135/documentation.html\",\"titleEn\":\"STM32MP135\"},\"category\":{\"primaryCategory\":\"Resource Selector\",\"type\":\"Tools &amp; software\",\"version\":\"\"},\"attributes\":{\"version\":\"4.63.0\",\"language\":\"en\"},\"components\"